<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9446] MVCC: Races in Vacuum worker on cache stop.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9446</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;For now, partition store BTree can be destroyed while vacuum in progress regardless partition reservations which causes VacuumTask failure without&#160;negative side effect (such as worker failure or any hanging).&lt;br/&gt;
 VacuumTask successfully catch and log the exception, but further check in afterTest() method reports vacuum failure.&lt;br/&gt;
 For now vacuum is disabled for this test.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should fix vacuum failure properly in that case and&#160;fix CacheMvccPartitionedSqlQueriesTest.testDistributedJoinSimple() test.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
